The look is inspired by the rogatywka, the Krakow cap, and by Polish folk
art: the painted flowers of Zalipie, folk painting from Lipnica Murowana,
Boleslawiec pottery and kilim rugs. The motifs are drawn from scratch in
simple shapes; no existing design was copied.

The fonts Tiny5 and Silkscreen are not part of these files. They are
installed from npm and are under the SIL Open Font License 1.1.


